plugin-hostd-protocol (0.21.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * nodejs-plugin-hostd-protocol, a new package: the npm package
    @openmixer/plugin-hostd-protocol as npm pack packs it, under
    /usr/lib/node_modules/@openmixer/plugin-hostd-protocol, its
    @openmixer/omx-contract a link to the omx-contract package's tree, so a
    Node consumer builds against the published package, never the
    registry's.
  * The npm package no longer packs the codec's build tree
    (clients/typescript/codec/node_modules: typescript, ajv and the
    registry's @openmixer/omx-contract, which the codec read before its
    consumer's) nor its compiled tests.
  * python3-plugin-hostd-protocol's description names the TypeScript package
    as it is, @openmixer/plugin-hostd-protocol.

