plugin-hostd-protocol (0.8.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The vocabulary sorting pass: the probe words (outcomes, reasons, steps,
    signals) and the pin verdict and pool words are domains of this package
    (probe, pin) and protocol.h generates its lists from them; the parameter
    scales are read from omx-contract's domain param; GroupingReason and
    RETRY_REASONS of both clients are written from plugin-hostd's domain
    plugin-hostd/grouping; the shared verbs and host words are read from
    omx-clap's domains, under the new omx-clap names.

